%% Mermaid sequence: Analyze/Compose pipeline (simplified)
sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Worker (Celery)
  participant L as LangGraph
  participant G as Guardian
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant Obj as Object Storage
  W->>L: Start Analyze (Events/Timeline/Entities)
  L-->>W: Lane outputs (JSON/MD)
  W->>Obj: PUT analysis artifacts
  W->>DB: INSERT artifacts (DRAFT)
  W->>G: submit READY checks
  G->>DB: decision history + state READY
  W->>L: Start Compose (Outline→Sections→QA→Weave)
  L-->>W: Deliverables (MD/DOCX)
  W->>Obj: PUT compose deliverables
  W->>DB: INSERT artifacts (DRAFT); submit to Guardian
